WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.183 --> 00:00:01.784
- There are a lot of inspiring women

00:00:01.784 --> 00:00:04.176
out there who should be known

00:00:04.176 --> 00:00:07.035
and no one ever talks about them.

00:00:07.035 --> 00:00:08.617
They should be talked about.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:11.534
(slow piano music)

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.027
- I've always been a fit and active

00:00:15.027 --> 00:00:18.195
and very healthy person,
but just under a year ago,

00:00:18.195 --> 00:00:21.249
I was diagnosed with stage
four cervical cancer.

00:00:21.249 --> 00:00:23.462
My three children are very different ages.

00:00:23.462 --> 00:00:26.447
Telling Ruby was particularly difficult.

00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:31.247
- When I first found out
that my mum had cancer,

00:00:31.247 --> 00:00:33.925
I don't think I was affected that much

00:00:33.925 --> 00:00:35.854
or as much as I should have been.

00:00:35.854 --> 00:00:39.630
I think my mum kept a very
positive nature about her.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.797
She didn't tell us that
she was feeling sick and...

00:00:48.772 --> 00:00:51.439
She's just so inspiring.

00:00:51.439 --> 00:00:54.677
- For me, today represents
self-confidence,

00:00:54.677 --> 00:00:57.727
self-love, and an attitude of fuck it.

00:00:57.727 --> 00:00:59.636
I don't care what anyone
else thinks of me.

00:00:59.636 --> 00:01:02.655
This is who I am and
I'm not afraid to be me

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:05.931
and I hope that Ruby never forgets that.

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:08.514
- Jo has just run at this thing

00:01:09.739 --> 00:01:13.067
with so much power and so much tenacity

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:15.900
that it seems only right to create

00:01:16.939 --> 00:01:19.115
and turn her into a Wonder Woman today

00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:22.635
and we are celebrating life
and the fight for life.

00:01:22.635 --> 00:01:24.992
I'm really looking forward
to capturing this today,

00:01:24.992 --> 00:01:27.723
but in particular, for
Ruby so that she can

00:01:27.723 --> 00:01:29.897
always look back at these photographs

00:01:29.897 --> 00:01:32.064
and draw strength and power

00:01:32.064 --> 00:01:33.707
from the knowledge that they fought this

00:01:33.707 --> 00:01:35.595
and they fought this
together and they won.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.448
(slow music)

00:01:36.448 --> 00:01:39.152
- [Ruby] My mum talks about
beauty being on the inside

00:01:39.152 --> 00:01:40.902
rather than the outside a lot.

00:01:40.902 --> 00:01:44.550
I know she tries her hardest,
but everyone is affected by

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:46.949
all that pressure from society

00:01:46.949 --> 00:01:48.837
and the big signs and the big companies

00:01:48.837 --> 00:01:50.960
that tell you you have to be beautiful

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.523
to be successful really.

00:01:52.523 --> 00:01:54.683
- I wanted Ruby to do this shoot

00:01:54.683 --> 00:01:57.402
and I thought about doing it probably

00:01:57.402 --> 00:01:58.747
when she was a little bit older,

00:01:58.747 --> 00:02:00.338
but this opportunity came up.

00:02:00.338 --> 00:02:02.780
The past year, going through
cancer and chemotherapy

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.446
has taught me that you have to learn

00:02:04.446 --> 00:02:06.408
in your confidence about yourself

00:02:06.408 --> 00:02:08.403
and that really has to come from within

00:02:08.403 --> 00:02:09.932
because it's what's in your heart

00:02:09.932 --> 00:02:12.838
and your personality
that makes you beautiful

00:02:12.838 --> 00:02:15.771
and the way you express
that is just an expression

00:02:15.771 --> 00:02:18.276
and sadly, going through
things like cancer

00:02:18.276 --> 00:02:19.931
make you find that, but I hope that

00:02:19.931 --> 00:02:21.702
most people can find it themselves

00:02:21.702 --> 00:02:23.441
without having to go through cancer

00:02:23.441 --> 00:02:25.243
and I hope that this sets her up for life

00:02:25.243 --> 00:02:27.471
to see her inner strength and beauty.

00:02:27.471 --> 00:02:29.398
- [Ruby] I'm very lucky
to be able to do this

00:02:29.398 --> 00:02:31.830
and not a lot of people can do this.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.422
My mum is definitely a Wonder Woman.

00:02:34.422 --> 00:02:36.001
She doesn't need a costume.

00:02:36.001 --> 00:02:39.403
She works so hard to make
everyone else feel better.

00:02:39.403 --> 00:02:42.721
She definitely deserves
the label of Wonder Woman.

00:02:42.721 --> 00:02:45.867
I'm really excited to
capture this moment in time

00:02:45.867 --> 00:02:50.438
and remember how beautiful
and amazing and strong she is.

00:02:50.438 --> 00:02:53.188
(building music)

00:02:56.006 --> 00:02:57.222
- [Sasha] Are you ready?

00:02:57.222 --> 00:02:58.055
- Yes.

00:02:59.505 --> 00:03:03.672
(screams and laughs)
(triumphant music)

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.206
Oh my god, look at you.

00:03:07.206 --> 00:03:09.403
Look at you, you look amazing.

00:03:09.403 --> 00:03:11.697
You look so beautiful.

00:03:11.697 --> 00:03:14.427
All grown up, so gorgeous, so beautiful.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.523
You are so beautiful.

00:03:16.523 --> 00:03:17.856
So so beautiful.

00:03:20.651 --> 00:03:21.984
How do you feel?

00:03:23.062 --> 00:03:25.168
Speechless (laughs)?
- Yeah.

00:03:25.168 --> 00:03:27.738
- [Jo] Are you amazed at
how gorgeous you look?

00:03:27.738 --> 00:03:29.159
- [Ruby] You look gorgeous too.

00:03:29.159 --> 00:03:30.183
- [Jo] Thank you.

00:03:30.183 --> 00:03:31.599
I feel great.

00:03:31.599 --> 00:03:35.766
I feel strong, I feel powerful,
and I'm so proud of you.

00:03:37.676 --> 00:03:40.519
- [Ruby] For my mum, it's
not really much change.

00:03:40.519 --> 00:03:42.268
She's always been a Wonder Woman.

00:03:42.268 --> 00:03:43.121
- [Jo] Aww.

00:03:43.121 --> 00:03:46.375
- I feel so emotional about the whole day

00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:49.276
and how amazing it is and how good it is

00:03:49.276 --> 00:03:51.589
to be here with my mum.

00:03:51.589 --> 00:03:53.921
I feel like the strongest
person in the world.

00:03:53.921 --> 00:03:57.377
I feel like I could be Wonder Woman.

00:03:57.377 --> 00:04:00.529
- This is exactly what I was hoping for.

00:04:00.529 --> 00:04:02.183
In fact, it's more than what I was hoping.

00:04:02.183 --> 00:04:05.809
To hear Ruby say that she feels so strong

00:04:05.809 --> 00:04:07.547
is more important to me than her

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.404
saying how beautiful she is,

00:04:09.404 --> 00:04:10.886
but just feeling that sense of

00:04:10.886 --> 00:04:13.276
empowerment is just fantastic.

00:04:13.276 --> 00:04:17.750
I hope today gives you
self-love and appreciation

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:21.015
and just
(slow piano music)

00:04:21.015 --> 00:04:23.519
the strength and the power to be yourself

00:04:23.519 --> 00:04:26.420
and just be you because you are amazing

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:27.924
and don't let anyone else tell you

00:04:27.924 --> 00:04:31.497
to be anything else but Ruby
'cause Ruby is the best.

00:04:31.497 --> 00:04:33.794
- You're where I get all the beauty from.

00:04:33.794 --> 00:04:36.297
I think you're already Wonder Woman.

00:04:36.297 --> 00:04:39.714
You don't need any hair or makeup at all.

00:04:41.513 --> 00:04:43.013
- You're gorgeous.

00:04:44.681 --> 00:04:49.161
- My mum has taught me that
I shouldn't let anything

00:04:49.161 --> 00:04:51.135
stop me from doing what I want to do.

00:04:51.135 --> 00:04:53.641
She's taught me that
no matter what happens,

00:04:53.641 --> 00:04:56.703
I should stay strong and look up

00:04:56.703 --> 00:04:58.429
and know that being pushed down

00:04:58.429 --> 00:05:02.179
is a lot like a setup
for a comeback, really.

